    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock down coins one after another and obtain the pirate's treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head for the treasure islands and defeat the enemies that stand in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the riches shall be yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete to earn as many coins as possible within the time limit and aim for a high spot on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or multiplayer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Endless]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for as long as you like without a time limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The coins you've earned will persist between tries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Ranking]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn a rank for both Score Attack and Endless modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against players worldwide!</p>",
